# T2c round 2: the 303s are monophonic. Two keys held on the same part, the first released: the
# note keeps sounding (voices 1). When the last key is released the part goes off (voices 0).
# The classic X0X keyboard path (REC + keys on the GLOBAL page), minimised by the reviewer.
tap EDIT
turn ALGO 2 114
tap REC
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
tap GLO
events legato_cut_events.txt
key 17 down
wait 100
key 19 down
wait 100
key 17 up
wait 3000
expect voices 1
key 19 up
wait 3000
expect voices 0
eventsstop
